data: {"id": "41b3a29374ae451d-thinking-parallel_evidence-1984", "run_id": "41b3a29374ae451d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Good. Node2 is **Ready**. Let me now summarize what I have and check for completeness against the runbook requirements.\n\n**Evidence Summary:**\n\n1. **Pod identity confirmed**: `aiops-case-v13/workload`, UID `12660e96-f42a-4f91-bedb-39d6f3fca75b`, on `node2`\n\n2. **Terminating state confirmed**: \n   - `kubectl describe` shows `status: Terminating`\n   - `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-14T08:16:00Z` is set\n   - `deletionGracePeriodSeconds: 3900` (65 min)\n   - `phase: Running` in YAML (expected during ter", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789369922610, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

